          {
            "title": "Plant Watering Robot",
            "meta": "Personal Use",
            "badge": "",
            "body": "- Built a solar-powered autonomous system using 10W external batteries to power soil moisture sensors, I2C modules, servo motors, pumps, and a microcontroller.\n- Built an intuitive user interface with an LCD display and keypad module that lets users schedule regular watering cycles, set the amount of water to pour, and see the countdown to watering.\n- With this project, my goal wasn't efficiency so much as learning how to integrate different systems into the same codebase.",
            "tags": [
              "Arduino",
