            "title": "Auto Dev. Env. (ADE)",
            "meta": "Personal Use",
            "badge": "",
            "body": "- Built an autonomous coding agent that writes, tests, and debugs code locally based on user-defined acceptance criteria.\n- Deployed a quantized 7B LLM locally via Ollama on an 8GB VRAM / 32GB RAM hardware setup with SSH access for remote dev work.\n- Ran the entire physical compute setup off an off-grid 400W solar array and 2000Wh battery rig to bypass cloud compute costs.",
