            "title": "Glendale Ready",
            "meta": "Jewel City Hacks",
            "badge": "1st Place",
            "body": "- Built an AI-powered civic reporting app using Gemini Vision to classify infrastructure issues from user photos, route them to the correct LA 311 form, and submit tickets directly to the Mayor’s Office.\n- Scraped the 311 portal with Python to map its form schema, enabling dynamic field generation for different request categories.\n- Took 2nd place out of \\~20 teams (plus a distinction award for presentation) pitching live to 100+ attendees, including local investors and city representatives.",
